&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:2.9pt;margin-bottom:2.9pt;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;監査証明業務に&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:2.9pt;margin-bottom:2.9pt;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;基づく報酬(百万円)&lt;/p&gt;
